<article id="post-10787" class="clearfix post-10787 page type-page status-publish hentry">
			<header class="entry-header">
			<h1 class="entry-title">Orientation Events on Campus</h1>		</header><!-- .entry-header -->
	
	<div class="entry-content">
        <div class="in-page-tabs"><ul id="menu-welcome-and-support-program" class="menu nav nav-tabs"><li id="menu-item-15439" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page"><a href="https://international.global.uconn.edu/gr-orientation/">Graduate Student</a></li><li id="menu-item-15333" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page"><a href="https://international.global.uconn.edu/ug-orientation/">Undergraduate Student</a></li><li id="menu-item-12164" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page current-menu-item page_item page-item-10787 current_page_item active "><a href="https://international.global.uconn.edu/orientation-at-uconn/">Exchange Programs and School of Law</a></li><li id="menu-item-12157" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page"><a href="https://international.global.uconn.edu/webinars/">New Student Webinars</a></li><li id="menu-item-13509" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page"><a href="https://international.global.uconn.edu/orientation-for-visiting-scholars/">Orientation for Visiting Scholars/Students</a></li></ul></div><div id="pl-10787"  class="panel-layout" ><div id="pg-10787-0"  class="panel-grid panel-no-style" ><div id="pgc-10787-0-0"  class="panel-grid-cell" ><div id="panel-10787-0-0-0" class="so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-first-child" data-index="0" ><div class="textwidget"></div></div><div id="panel-10787-0-0-1" class="so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce" data-index="1" ><h3 class="widget-title">Storrs Campus Exchange Program</h3><div class="textwidget"><p><b><i>Monday, August 24, 2026</i></b><br />
<a href="mailto:incoming_exchange@uconn.edu">Incoming Exchange Orientation</a>- Please contact the Experiential Global Learning department for details.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</div></div><div id="panel-10787-0-0-2" class="so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-last-child" data-index="2" ><h3 class="widget-title">School of Law</h3><div class="textwidget"><h2>JD, SJD, LLM and Law Exchange Programs</h2>
<p><strong>Thursday, August 27, 2026</strong></p>
<p><span class="ui-provider fz b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak" dir="ltr"><span class="ui-provider ed bii bij bik bil bim bin bio bip biq bir bis bit biu biv biw bix biy biz bja bjb bjc bjd bje bjf bjg bjh bji bjj bjk bjl bjm bjn bjo bjp" dir="ltr"><strong><span data-teams="true"> </span></strong></span></span>There will be a mandatory session for international F/J visa holders in the LLM and JD programs on <strong>Thursday, August 27, 2026</strong><strong> at 11:45 am - 12:50 pm in TBD.</strong> This required session will provide important visa information and requirements and allow students to meet the ISSS advisor, learn about the services ISSS provides and ask questions. This session will be part of the LLM Orientation. Attendance will be taken.</p>
<p>Contact: <a href="mailto:llm@uconn.edu" rel="">LLM</a> or <a href="mailto:lawexchange@uconn.edu" rel="">Law Exchange</a></p>
<p><a href="mailto:law.admissions@uconn.edu" rel="">JD</a> and <a href="mailto:sjd@uconn.edu" rel="">SJD</a> Students - Contact your program for details.<br />
<a class="btn btn-default" href="https://international.global.uconn.edu/welcome-program-handouts-law" role="button">View the Orientation Welcome Packet for Law Students</a></p>
</div></div></div></div></div>
        			</div><!-- .entry-content -->
	<footer class="entry-footer">
			</footer><!-- .entry-footer -->
</article><!-- #post-## -->
